uation%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Cat%29%3B%0A%20%20%20if%28punctuation%21%3D%3D%27%3E%27%26%26punctuation%21%3D%3D%27%3E%3D%27%29continue%3B%0A%20%20%20if%28readRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Cat%29%21%3D%3D%27punct%27%29return%20%5B%27error%27%2C%27malformed%20generic%20alias%20parameter%20delimiter%27%5D%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20if%28punctuation%3D%3D%3D%27%3E%27%7C%7Cpunctuation%3D%3D%3D%27%3E%3D%27%29return%20%5B%27parameters%27%2CString%28at%29%2Cpunctuation%3D%3D%3D%27%3E%3D%27%3F%27%3D%27%3A%27%27%2C...names%5D%3B%0A%20%20return%20%5B%27error%27%2C%27generic%20alias%20parameter%20bounds%20and%20defaults%20need%20their%20complete%20interpretation%27%5D%3B%0A%20%7D%0A%20return%20%5B%27error%27%2C%27unclosed%20generic%20alias%20parameter%20list%27%5D%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Additional%20directory%20retains%20original%20token%20coordinates%20for%20every%20default.%0A%20%2A%20Rows%20are%20name%2C%20default%20start%20token%2C%20end%20token%2C%20end%20punctuation%20offset%3B%20-1%0A%20%2A%20marks%20no%20default.%20The%20legacy%20explicit-parameter%20projection%20remains%20intact.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20names%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20starts%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20ends%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20offsets%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20close%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20remainder%0A%20%2A%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Afunction%20parameterDirectory%28names%2Cstarts%2Cends%2Coffsets%2Cclose%2Cremainder%29%7B%0A%20if%28remainder%21%3D%3D%27%27%26%26remainder%21%3D%3D%27%3D%27%29return%20%5B%27error%27%2C%27malformed%20generic%20alias%20parameter%20delimiter%27%5D%3B%0A%20const%20result%3D%5B%27parameters%27%2CString%28close%29%2Cremainder%2CString%28names.length%29%5D%3B%0A%20for%28let%20at%3D0%3Bat%3Cnames.length%3Bat%2B%3D1%29result.push%28readRequiredTextFact%28names%2Cat%29%2CreadRequiredTextFact%28starts%2Cat%29%2CreadRequiredTextFact%28ends%2Cat%29%2CreadRequiredTextFact%28offsets%2Cat%29%29%3B%0A%2